34:14.940 --> 34:16.120
but reading the primary

34:16.120 --> 34:17.020
source documents

34:17.020 --> 34:18.300
from 400 years ago

34:18.300 --> 34:19.960
feels like deciphering

34:19.960 --> 34:20.840
alien code.

34:21.000 --> 34:21.940
The density

34:21.940 --> 34:22.940
is just gone.

34:23.260 --> 34:23.380
Yeah.

34:23.620 --> 34:24.580
Okay, so Fleekshin

34:24.580 --> 34:25.600
has built this massive

34:25.600 --> 34:26.680
theory of mind,

34:27.080 --> 34:27.760
but they don't

34:27.760 --> 34:28.560
stop at theory.

34:28.960 --> 34:29.500
Chapter 16

34:29.500 --> 34:30.100
goes somewhere

34:30.100 --> 34:31.080
totally unexpected.

34:31.680 --> 34:32.280
They propose

34:32.280 --> 34:34.080
actual hypothetical

34:34.080 --> 34:35.320
programming languages

34:35.320 --> 34:36.580
designed to build

34:36.580 --> 34:37.220
these clipboard

34:37.220 --> 34:38.440
architectures natively.

34:38.640 --> 34:39.520
Yes, the constructive

34:39.520 --> 34:40.480
synthesis chapters.

34:40.840 --> 34:41.240
This is where

34:41.240 --> 34:42.120
the computer science

34:42.120 --> 34:42.840
truly shines.

34:43.180 --> 34:43.980
They propose a language

34:43.980 --> 34:44.920
called MML,

34:45.380 --> 34:46.800
the manifold mapping language.

34:46.940 --> 34:47.740
I am not a software

34:47.740 --> 34:48.220
engineer,

34:48.560 --> 34:50.140
but the way MML works

34:50.140 --> 34:52.160
sounds completely backward

34:52.160 --> 34:53.420
to how I understand coding.

34:53.620 --> 34:54.740
It is a paradigm shift.

34:55.060 --> 34:55.520
In a normal

34:55.520 --> 34:56.300
programming language

34:56.300 --> 34:56.920
like Python

34:56.920 --> 34:58.600
or C++I,

34:58.760 --> 34:59.660
you declare what

34:59.660 --> 35:00.180
the data is.

35:00.240 --> 35:00.480
You say,

35:00.600 --> 35:01.340
this is an integer

35:01.340 --> 35:02.520
or this is a string

35:02.520 --> 35:03.020
of text,

35:03.020 --> 35:03.880
and then you write

35:03.880 --> 35:05.260
functions to manipulate it.

35:05.580 --> 35:06.800
MML is a

35:06.800 --> 35:08.080
constraint-first language.

35:08.660 --> 35:09.320
You don't declare

35:09.320 --> 35:10.080
the data first.

35:10.420 --> 35:11.040
You declare the

35:11.040 --> 35:11.940
geometric properties

35:11.940 --> 35:12.640
of the region.

35:12.880 --> 35:13.560
You define the

35:13.560 --> 35:14.280
allowed entropy,

35:14.540 --> 35:15.540
the semantic curvature,

35:15.760 --> 35:16.640
the local density.

35:16.640 --> 35:17.880
You define the shape

35:17.880 --> 35:18.440
of the space

35:18.440 --> 35:19.100
before you ever

35:19.100 --> 35:20.220
put content into it.

35:20.380 --> 35:20.980
And it forces

35:20.980 --> 35:22.260
programmers to deal

35:22.260 --> 35:23.420
with memory compression

35:23.420 --> 35:24.340
explicitly.

35:25.280 --> 35:25.980
The text says,

35:26.280 --> 35:27.020
you have to declare

35:27.020 --> 35:27.640
your residuals,

35:28.360 --> 35:29.340
meaning you have

35:29.340 --> 35:30.180
to formally write

35:30.180 --> 35:31.040
code that states

35:31.040 --> 35:32.500
exactly what information

35:32.500 --> 35:33.760
survives the compression

35:33.760 --> 35:34.600
of a process

35:34.600 --> 35:35.620
and what is

35:35.620 --> 35:36.680
permanently discarded.

35:37.180 --> 35:37.900
You are programming

35:37.900 --> 35:39.280
the blazes on the trees.

35:39.420 --> 35:40.340
And to run MML,

35:40.560 --> 35:41.380
you need a new kind

35:41.380 --> 35:42.440
of runtime environment.

35:42.920 --> 35:43.920
Fliction proposes

35:43.920 --> 35:45.000
oblocosm.

35:45.400 --> 35:45.920
Oblocosm.

35:46.180 --> 35:47.040
This part was wild.

35:47.280 --> 35:47.400
It says,

35:47.480 --> 35:48.740
computation in oblocosm

35:48.740 --> 35:49.500
isn't executing

35:49.500 --> 35:50.740
lines of code sequentially.

35:51.320 --> 35:52.060
Computation is

35:52.060 --> 35:52.780
field evolution.

35:53.320 --> 35:54.120
Programs are conceived

35:54.120 --> 35:55.680
of as semantic bubbles.

35:56.000 --> 35:56.340
Yes.

35:56.940 --> 35:58.160
Let's try to visualize this.

35:58.160 --> 35:59.180
Imagine you want to write

35:59.180 --> 36:00.120
a simple program

36:00.120 --> 36:01.100
to add two and two.

36:01.460 --> 36:02.240
In oblocosm,

36:02.300 --> 36:02.840
the number two

36:02.840 --> 36:03.740
and the other number two

36:03.740 --> 36:04.620
are initiated

36:04.620 --> 36:06.480
as stable semantic bubbles.

36:06.980 --> 36:08.100
The plus operator

36:08.100 --> 36:09.380
defines a pressure point,

36:09.760 --> 36:11.160
a region of high curvature

36:11.160 --> 36:12.560
where they must interact.

36:12.900 --> 36:14.160
Okay, so the two bubbles

36:14.160 --> 36:15.660
float into this pressure point.

36:15.800 --> 36:16.360
Then what?

36:16.920 --> 36:18.100
Execution is just

36:18.100 --> 36:19.200
letting these bubbles

36:19.200 --> 36:20.280
interact under the

36:20.280 --> 36:21.240
geometric constraints

36:21.240 --> 36:21.800
you define.

36:22.260 --> 36:22.900
When they hit

36:22.900 --> 36:23.940
the plus pressure point,

36:24.060 --> 36:24.940
they fail to maintain

36:24.940 --> 36:26.740
stability as separate entities

36:26.740 --> 36:28.420
under that specific constraint.

36:28.800 --> 36:30.500
The local coherence

36:30.500 --> 36:31.980
demands a resolution.

36:32.540 --> 36:33.440
So they collapse together

36:33.440 --> 36:34.380
into a new,

36:34.640 --> 36:36.040
stable denouement bubble.

36:36.180 --> 36:36.420
Hmm.

36:36.960 --> 36:37.740
The number four.

36:37.840 --> 36:38.380
It's almost like

36:38.380 --> 36:39.240
organic chemistry.

36:39.500 --> 36:40.280
The atoms bond

36:40.280 --> 36:41.460
because the energetic state

36:41.460 --> 36:42.120
demands it.

36:42.220 --> 36:43.220
It is exactly like

36:43.220 --> 36:44.280
chemical thermodynamics

36:44.280 --> 36:45.280
but applied to logic.

36:45.720 --> 36:46.580
The operators are things

36:46.580 --> 36:47.060
like pop,

36:47.300 --> 36:47.580
bind,

36:47.740 --> 36:48.140
collapse,

36:48.240 --> 36:48.720
and refuse.

36:49.060 --> 36:50.260
And here's the genius part.

36:51.100 --> 36:51.840
What happens

36:51.840 --> 36:53.320
if you feed the program

36:53.320 --> 36:54.460
incompatible types?

36:55.120 --> 36:56.000
Say you try to add

36:56.000 --> 36:56.600
the number two

36:56.600 --> 36:57.380
in the word apple

36:57.380 --> 36:58.660
without defining

36:58.660 --> 36:59.600
a transition path.

36:59.720 --> 37:00.280
In Python,

37:00.580 --> 37:01.500
that throws an error

37:01.500 --> 37:02.660
and crashes the program.

37:03.060 --> 37:03.180
Right.

37:03.180 --> 37:03.940
In oblocosm,

37:04.020 --> 37:04.620
it doesn't crash

37:04.620 --> 37:05.560
with a syntax error.

37:06.080 --> 37:07.400
When two and apple interact,

37:07.500 --> 37:08.480
the local accessibility

37:08.480 --> 37:09.500
entropy S

37:09.500 --> 37:10.700
violently spikes.

37:11.100 --> 37:11.520
It exceeds

37:11.520 --> 37:12.740
the coherence phi.

37:13.100 --> 37:14.620
Because S is greater than phi,

37:14.760 --> 37:15.440
the xylomorphic

37:15.440 --> 37:16.760
stability condition fails.

37:17.140 --> 37:18.640
The bubbles literally pop.

37:18.840 --> 37:19.600
They dissipate

37:19.600 --> 37:20.800
into the background entropy.

37:21.000 --> 37:22.780
It is organically garbage

37:22.780 --> 37:24.000
collected by the physics

37:24.000 --> 37:24.680
of the environment.

37:24.680 --> 37:25.740
That is a radically

37:25.740 --> 37:26.420
different way

37:26.420 --> 37:27.640
of thinking about software.

37:28.140 --> 37:28.880
It's moving away

37:28.880 --> 37:29.520
from britter,

37:29.800 --> 37:30.980
symbolic rule following

37:30.980 --> 37:32.700
and toward fluid,

37:32.940 --> 37:34.020
geometric stabilization.

37:35.020 --> 37:35.440
And then,

37:35.740 --> 37:36.680
as if reinventing

37:36.680 --> 37:37.580
programming languages

37:37.580 --> 37:38.360
wasn't enough,

37:38.800 --> 37:39.540
Fliction takes this

37:39.540 --> 37:40.960
exact same mathematical

37:40.960 --> 37:42.080
framework and scales it

37:42.080 --> 37:42.620
up to the largest

37:42.620 --> 37:43.560
possible size.

37:44.280 --> 37:44.900
Chapter 18.

37:45.420 --> 37:46.600
Civilization as a

37:46.600 --> 37:47.700
Distributed Clipboard

37:47.700 --> 37:48.360
Manifold.

37:48.600 --> 37:49.520
This is the crescendo

37:49.520 --> 37:50.320
of the monograph.

37:50.560 --> 37:51.420
It raises a profound

37:51.420 --> 37:51.880
question.

37:52.520 --> 37:53.580
What actually is

37:53.580 --> 37:54.680
a human civilization?

37:55.320 --> 37:56.140
Under this framework,

37:56.260 --> 37:57.260
a civilization is not

37:57.260 --> 37:58.220
a collection of buildings

37:58.220 --> 37:59.000
or an economy.

37:59.320 --> 38:00.400
It is a massively

38:00.400 --> 38:01.960
distributed sheaf structure.

38:02.300 --> 38:03.500
It is a shared network

38:03.500 --> 38:05.220
of externalized clipboards.

38:05.440 --> 38:06.460
So, a library,

38:06.880 --> 38:07.820
a physical library

38:07.820 --> 38:08.620
full of books,

38:09.040 --> 38:09.920
is just an incredibly

38:09.920 --> 38:10.840
dense region

38:10.840 --> 38:11.940
of low entropy

38:11.940 --> 38:13.000
and high coherence.

38:13.060 --> 38:13.520
Exactly.

38:13.780 --> 38:14.820
And the scientific literature,

38:15.060 --> 38:16.040
the network of published

38:16.040 --> 38:16.900
papers and journals,

38:17.260 --> 38:18.040
is a region with

38:18.040 --> 38:19.020
extremely tight

38:19.020 --> 38:19.780
sheaf constraints.

38:19.780 --> 38:20.940
Think about what peer

38:20.940 --> 38:22.240
review and experimental

38:22.240 --> 38:23.520
reproducibility actually

38:23.520 --> 38:24.000
are.

38:24.120 --> 38:25.040
They are admissibility

38:25.040 --> 38:25.620
regulators.

38:26.060 --> 38:26.580
Precisely.

38:27.260 --> 38:28.480
They are strict geometric

38:28.480 --> 38:29.760
filters designed to ensure

38:29.760 --> 38:30.500
that when a scientist

38:30.500 --> 38:31.740
creates a new local

38:31.740 --> 38:32.720
clipboard, a new

38:32.720 --> 38:34.260
discovery, it can

38:34.260 --> 38:35.360
