38:35.360 --> 38:35.960
to the global

38:35.960 --> 38:37.260
cognitive sheaf of

38:37.260 --> 38:38.020
human knowledge

38:38.020 --> 38:39.240
without creating

38:39.240 --> 38:40.200
an H1 obstruction.

38:40.780 --> 38:41.640
If a paper's math

38:41.640 --> 38:42.840
is wrong, it fails to

38:42.840 --> 38:44.160
glue, it is rejected.

38:44.460 --> 38:45.480
This framework is such

38:45.480 --> 38:46.540
a visceral explanation

38:46.540 --> 38:47.920
for why destroying

38:47.920 --> 38:49.020
a library or losing

38:49.020 --> 38:49.840
a culture's oral

38:49.840 --> 38:51.140
tradition is so

38:51.140 --> 38:52.320
catastrophically damaging.

38:52.460 --> 38:52.860
It's not just

38:52.860 --> 38:53.540
losing data.

38:54.020 --> 38:55.060
It is the deepest

38:55.060 --> 38:56.980
invariant of civilization.

38:57.240 --> 38:57.400
Right.

38:57.660 --> 38:58.900
Recursive reenterability.

38:59.200 --> 38:59.900
You don't have to

38:59.900 --> 39:00.940
reinvent the wheel

39:00.940 --> 39:01.820
or agriculture

39:01.820 --> 39:02.660
or calculus

39:02.660 --> 39:04.100
because your ancestors

39:04.100 --> 39:05.080
compressed those

39:05.080 --> 39:06.720
monumental high curvature

39:06.720 --> 39:08.020
struggles into

39:08.020 --> 39:09.100
denouement for you.

39:09.180 --> 39:09.440
Right.

39:09.520 --> 39:10.620
When a library burns

39:10.620 --> 39:11.480
like the Library of

39:11.480 --> 39:12.460
