39:13.340 --> 39:14.560
You delete the traversal

39:14.560 --> 39:15.360
density of the row

39:15.360 --> 39:15.860
parameter.

39:15.860 --> 39:17.860
You instantly, violently

39:17.860 --> 39:18.660
increase the

39:18.660 --> 39:19.800
accessibility entropy

39:19.800 --> 39:20.480
for the entire

39:20.480 --> 39:21.160
